{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42166","headline":"附池州薛郎中书因寄歙州张员外 · 徐铉","name":"附池州薛郎中书因寄歙州张员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新安从事旧台郎，直气多才不可忘。\n一旦江山驰别梦，几年簪绂共周行。\n岐分出处何方是，情共穷通此义长。\n因附邻州寄消息，接舆今日信爲狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}